NY SLA (data.ny.gov): active 9s3h-dpkz (open), inactive 6dg3-2z7i (closed); NYC counties Bronx/Kings/New York/Queens/Richmond; names = DBA, LegalName; point from Georeference. In both -> open.
UK FSA (api.ratings.food.gov.uk, x-api-version 2): coverage only; Establishments?name=..&latitude&longitude&maxDistanceLimit=0.1 (miles~160m, then 100 m filter).
Metric: closed share among matched, Paris+NY pooled, Wilson 95%. Second: matched share per city. Verdict: lower>=10% -> closed-place filter; upper<5% -> not a bottleneck; else extend sample to 1000.
